**What We Do**

EDG Patio & Shade is the go-to design and supply partner for
professionals installing motorized pergolas, retractable screens, and
glass enclosure systems. We work with builders, architects, designers,
and dealers across the country---providing system selection, engineering
support, and project coordination so they can deliver better outdoor
spaces to their clients.

Locally, we also serve homeowners directly across the Chicago-Milwaukee
corridor with full-service design, supply, and installation from our own
crews.

When clients are ready to complete their outdoor space, we handle
outdoor kitchens, furniture, heating systems, and umbrella systems.

**Business Model**

