                           Full-service: design, supply, and installation
                           by our own crews.
  ------------------------ ----------------------------------------------

**Our Niche**

We own the design/supply partner space for motorized outdoor systems.
Most manufacturers sell through locked-in local dealers. Most dealers
only know one brand. EDG sits in the middle---system-agnostic,
technically deep, and built to support professionals who need a reliable
specialty partner, not another vendor pitch.

For local projects, we bring the same expertise plus our own
installation crews for a true white-glove experience.

